# Cursor rules for NixOS Cluster

**Primary reference:** [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) — universal rules, style, and
safety constraints. This file only adds Cursor-specific shortcuts; it must not
duplicate or contradict AGENTS.md.

## Non-negotiable

- Declarative only. Edit `.nix` files and deploy with `just deploy`; never
  `systemctl enable/start` a persistent service, `nix-env -i`, or edit `/etc`
  directly.
- Use `lib.mkOptionDefault` for lists and mergeable attrs in shared modules.

## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `just check` | quick flake validation (no build) |
| `just build` | build the local host toplevel |
| `just switch` | apply to the local host |
| `just test-apply` | build + test activation without a permanent switch |
| `just deploy [<host>]` | build + deploy to all or one host |
| `just rollback` | roll back the local host |
| `just full-check` | full pre-commit validation (`scripts/check.sh`) |

## Working on changes

- Work in an issue worktree: `just new-worktree NNN`.
- Validate with `just check` before committing; `git add` new files (Nix only
  sees git-tracked files).
- Follow the task guides in [`agents/skills/`](agents/skills/) for deploy,
  add-service, K8s workloads, and secrets.
